{"title":"游戏开发学习","uid":"34ac6d5d75e1315e5b67548802a9f46a","slug":"游戏开发学习","date":"2026-04-19T05:26:31.000Z","updated":"2026-05-10T12:27:22.590Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/游戏开发学习.json","keywords":"Catice, 猫冰","cover":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"0-前置知识\"><a href=\"#0-前置知识\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"0.前置知识\"></a>0.前置知识</h2><p><strong>QT与SFML的区别</strong><br>一句话总结：<br>QT是一个侧重界面布局、业务逻辑与跨平台应用的<strong>完整应用框架</strong>（含GUI、网络、数据库等），而SFML是一个专注于2D&#x2F;3D图形渲染、游戏输入和音频处理的<strong>轻量级多媒体库</strong><br>建议：<br>想通过折腾底层逻辑来提升编程内功，选 SFML；想快速做出有专业界面的实用工具，选 Qt</p>\n<p>最后得出结论，我们提升编程能力可以通过开发游戏，而开发游戏则最好使用SFML入门，搞懂底层原理</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-SFML入门案例\"><a href=\"#1-SFML入门案例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1.SFML入门案例\"></a>1.SFML入门案例</h2><p><strong>给VS2022配置SFML库</strong><br>Visual Studio 2022 没有内置 SFML 库<br>VS 2022 默认只包含了微软自家的开发工具。SFML 是一个第三方库，需要你手动下载并配置</p>\n<p>这里我们选择手动链接外部库的方式配置SFML<br>下载完SFML的库文件后将它放进某个Libraries文件夹里，并通过名称+版本标示库</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一步：设置头文件路径<ul>\n<li>这是为了让 VS 明白 #include &lt;SFML&#x2F;Graphics.hpp&gt; 到底指向硬盘里的哪个文件</li>\n<li>在全局附加包含目录 (Additional Include Directories)中，添加SFML库的include文件夹</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>第二步：设置库文件路径<ul>\n<li>这是为了让VS知道lib文件放哪</li>\n<li>附加库目录 (Additional Library Directories) 中，添加SFML的lib文件夹</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>第三步：输入具体库文件名<ul>\n<li>光告诉 VS 文件夹在哪还不够，还得告诉它具体要用哪几个 .lib 文件</li>\n<li>附加依赖项 (Additional Dependencies) 中，根据你的运行模式手动输入需要的库文件名</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>第四步：防止dll文件<ul>\n<li>将SFML库的dll文件，全部粘贴到项目输出.exe文件的同级目录下</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>.lib文件和.dll文件的区别</strong><br>总结：简单来说，.lib 文件是给编译器看的，而 .dll 文件是给操作系统看的<br>在 C++ 开发中，程序要经历两个主要阶段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>编译链接阶段（VS 内部）：<br>当你按下“生成解决方案”时，VS 需要知道 SFML 里的函数长什么样、怎么调用。这时候它读取的是 .lib 文件。如果配置正确，它会生成一个 .exe 文件</li>\n<li>运行阶段（Windows 桌面）：<br>当你双击运行那个 .exe 时，Windows 接管了程序，它发现你的代码里调用了“画一个圆”的函数，但这个函数的具体实现代码并没有包含在 .exe 里面，而是留在了一个外部的 .dll (Dynamic Link Library，动态链接库) 文件里</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>SFML入门案例</strong></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;SFML/Graphics.hpp&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">int main() &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 1. 创建一个 800x600 的窗口</span><br><span class=\"line\">    sf::RenderWindow window(sf::VideoMode(800, 600), &quot;My SFML Game&quot;);</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 2. 创建一个图形对象（绿色的圆）</span><br><span class=\"line\">    sf::CircleShape shape(50.f);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    shape.setFillColor(sf::Color::Green);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    shape.setPosition(375.f, 275.f);</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 3. 游戏主循环</span><br><span class=\"line\">    while (window.isOpen()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        // --- A. 事件处理 (Events) ---</span><br><span class=\"line\">        sf::Event event;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        while (window.pollEvent(event)) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            if (event.type == sf::Event::Closed)</span><br><span class=\"line\">                window.close();</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        // --- B. 逻辑更新 (Update) ---</span><br><span class=\"line\">        // 这里可以写 shape.move(0.1f, 0.f); 让圆动起来</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        // --- C. 渲染绘图 (Draw) ---</span><br><span class=\"line\">        window.clear();          // 清除上一帧</span><br><span class=\"line\">        window.draw(shape);      // 画出现在的图形</span><br><span class=\"line\">        window.display();        // 显示在屏幕上</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    return 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>注意，上述是旧版本的测试代码<br><strong>新版本测试代码</strong></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;SFML/Graphics.hpp&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">int main() &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 1. 创建渲染窗口 (SFML 3.x 依然使用 VideoMode)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 注意：SFML 3 引入了更多显式的构造方式，但这种写法依然通用</span><br><span class=\"line\">    sf::RenderWindow window(sf::VideoMode(&#123;800, 600&#125;), &quot;SFML 3.1.0 Test&quot;);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    window.setFramerateLimit(60);</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 2. 创建一个圆形状</span><br><span class=\"line\">    sf::CircleShape shape(50.f);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    shape.setFillColor(sf::Color::Green);</span><br><span class=\"line\">    shape.setOrigin(&#123;50.f, 50.f&#125;); // 设置原点在圆心</span><br><span class=\"line\">    shape.setPosition(&#123;400.f, 300.f&#125;);</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    std::cout &lt;&lt; &quot;SFML Window is running...&quot; &lt;&lt; std::endl;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    // 3. 游戏主循环</span><br><span class=\"line\">    while (window.isOpen()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        // 事件处理 (SFML 3 推荐使用这种轮询方式)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        while (const std::optional event = window.pollEvent()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            // 关闭窗口事件</span><br><span class=\"line\">            if (event-&gt;is&lt;sf::Event::Closed&gt;()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">                window.close();</span><br><span class=\"line\">            &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            // 按键按下事件</span><br><span class=\"line\">            if (const auto* keyPressed = event-&gt;getIf&lt;sf::Event::KeyPressed&gt;()) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">                if (keyPressed-&gt;code == sf::Keyboard::Key::Escape) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    window.close();</span><br><span class=\"line\">                &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">            &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        // 4. 渲染逻辑</span><br><span class=\"line\">        window.clear(sf::Color::Black); // 清屏（黑色）</span><br><span class=\"line\">        window.draw(shape);             // 画圆</span><br><span class=\"line\">        window.display();               // 显示内容</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    return 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"2-导入一个现有的游戏项目\"><a href=\"#2-导入一个现有的游戏项目\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.导入一个现有的游戏项目\"></a>2.导入一个现有的游戏项目</h2><p>如果是VS2022的项目，可以直接使用.sln文件直接导入<br>并且可以使用vcpkg包管理工具，来配置对应的依赖</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-游戏基本框架学习\"><a href=\"#3-游戏基本框架学习\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.游戏基本框架学习\"></a>3.游戏基本框架学习</h2><p>游戏的基本框架为：<br>一个死循环，不断地执行下列的操作</p>\n<ul>\n<li>读取操作</li>\n<li>处理数据</li>\n<li>绘制图形</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在编写一个具体的游戏之前，需要先思考清楚，这个游戏的上述三个板块会是什么样的<br>以及如何设计游戏的数据结构来表示数据<br>最后在编写代码</p>\n<p>在编写代码时，遵循先框架再细化的原则<br>细节部分先使用注释代替</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">// 读取操作</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">// 处理数据</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">// 绘制图形</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">// 动态延时</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"4-游戏开发知识点\"><a href=\"#4-游戏开发知识点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.游戏开发知识点\"></a>4.游戏开发知识点</h2><p><strong>sfml中的绘图原理</strong><br>使用<code>sf::Texture texture</code>首先将纹理加载出来<br>在使用<code>sf::Sprite sprite</code>创建一个图像，图像使用了texture的纹理</p>\n<p><strong>动画的实现原理</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>序列帧动画<br>一组图片播放，利用视觉暂留效应让画面动起来</li>\n<li>关键帧动画<br>需要用到骨骼等更高技术力的东西，暂不讨论</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"998-Adventurer冒险者游戏开发\"><a href=\"#998-Adventurer冒险者游戏开发\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"998.Adventurer冒险者游戏开发\"></a>998.Adventurer冒险者游戏开发</h2><ol>\n<li>拟游戏需求文档<br>在文档里把游戏最基础的玩法与逻辑写清楚，可以使用AI辅助写</li>\n<li>将需求文档丢给AI<br>千万不要直接把整个文档丢给 AI 让它写完整代码，那绝对会演变成一场灾难。<br>最科学的协作流程是：“结构先行，模块拆解，逐个击破”。<ol>\n<li>让 AI 做“架构师”（不要写具体逻辑）</li>\n<li>让 AI 写“骨架”（头文件）</li>\n<li>分功能模块实现（最核心的一步）</li>\n<li>由你来“手动组装”</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>所以，可以直接将文档发送给AI，并说：<br>请帮我分析这个需求，并设计出项目的文件夹结构和类清单。暂时不需要写代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"999-学习过程中的补充知识\"><a href=\"#999-学习过程中的补充知识\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"999.学习过程中的补充知识\"></a>999.学习过程中的补充知识</h2><p><strong>MIT与GNU的区别</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>MIT 协议（极致的宽容）：<br>它的核心逻辑是：“拿去用吧，只要别告我就行。” 它几乎不对使用者做任何限制。你可以修改它、闭源它、甚至把它拿去卖钱</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>GNU GPL 协议（传染性的自由）：<br>它的核心逻辑是：“自由是属于代码的，谁也别想独占。”<br>它具有<strong>“传染性”</strong>。如果你用了 GPL 的代码并进行了修改或集成，那么你的整个项目也必须开源，并且必须同样使用 GPL 协议</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","text":"0.前置知识QT与SFML的区别一句话总结：QT是一个侧重界面布局、业务逻辑与跨平台应用的完整应用框架（含GUI、网络、数据库等），而SFML是一个专注于2D/...","permalink":"/post/游戏开发学习","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"4.2k","symbolsTime":"4 mins."},"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"C/C++","slug":"C-C","count":3,"path":"api/tags/C-C.json"},{"name":"SFML","slug":"SFML","count":1,"path":"api/tags/SFML.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#0-%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86\"><span class=\"toc-text\">0.前置知识</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#1-SFML%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B\"><span class=\"toc-text\">1.SFML入门案例</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#2-%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E7%9A%84%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE\"><span class=\"toc-text\">2.导入一个现有的游戏项目</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#3-%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0\"><span class=\"toc-text\">3.游戏基本框架学习</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#4-%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9\"><span class=\"toc-text\">4.游戏开发知识点</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#998-Adventurer%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9%E8%80%85%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91\"><span class=\"toc-text\">998.Adventurer冒险者游戏开发</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#999-%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86\"><span class=\"toc-text\">999.学习过程中的补充知识</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"猫冰","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/MB-drinking.png","link":"/","description":"小猫用来存博客的地方（也会发一点有趣的东西）","socials":{"github":"","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{"github":"https://github.com/C0P1Fur","twitter":"https://x.com/_Caticee","customs":{"bilibili":{"icon":"/images/bilibili.svg","link":"https://space.bilibili.com/2140016240"}}}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"网页开发学习","uid":"94a182924a01acddf0d447f3050b36f6","slug":"网页开发学习","date":"2026-05-12T11:36:55.000Z","updated":"2026-05-12T11:36:55.943Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/网页开发学习.json","keywords":"Catice, 猫冰","cover":null,"text":"","permalink":"/post/网页开发学习","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":0,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[],"tags":[],"author":{"name":"猫冰","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/MB-drinking.png","link":"/","description":"小猫用来存博客的地方（也会发一点有趣的东西）","socials":{"github":"","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{"github":"https://github.com/C0P1Fur","twitter":"https://x.com/_Caticee","customs":{"bilibili":{"icon":"/images/bilibili.svg","link":"https://space.bilibili.com/2140016240"}}}}}},"next_post":{"title":"AI_AGENT学习笔记","uid":"9173948869f3f5492538d5092b45a042","slug":"AI-AGENT学习笔记","date":"2026-03-29T14:16:26.000Z","updated":"2026-03-29T15:02:58.323Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/AI-AGENT学习笔记.json","keywords":"Catice, 猫冰","cover":null,"text":"0.AI大模型 VS AI智能体AI大模型是通过问答，来用来回答问题的工具，像是会思考的大脑AI智能体可以通过对AI大模型的应用，形成一个完整的工具链解决问题，...","permalink":"/post/AI-AGENT学习笔记","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":420,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"tutorial","slug":"tutorial","count":10,"path":"api/categories/tutorial.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"AI","slug":"AI","count":1,"path":"api/tags/AI.json"},{"name":"agent","slug":"agent","count":1,"path":"api/tags/agent.json"}],"author":{"name":"猫冰","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/MB-drinking.png","link":"/","description":"小猫用来存博客的地方（也会发一点有趣的东西）","socials":{"github":"","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{"github":"https://github.com/C0P1Fur","twitter":"https://x.com/_Caticee","customs":{"bilibili":{"icon":"/images/bilibili.svg","link":"https://space.bilibili.com/2140016240"}}}}}}}